<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<UserControl
    x:Class="Phoenix.Controls.Hub.WinUI.Panels.UserManagementPanel.UserManagementView"
    xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
    xmlns:local="using:Phoenix.Controls.Hub.WinUI.Panels.UserManagementPanel"
    xmlns:cmn="using:Phoenix.Controls.Hub.WinUI.Panels.Common"
    xmlns:loc="using:Phoenix.Controls.Hub.WinUI.Localization"
    HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
    VerticalAlignment="Stretch"
    HorizontalContentAlignment="Stretch"
    VerticalContentAlignment="Stretch"
    AutomationProperties.Name="User Management page"
    AutomationProperties.HelpText="Welcomes, first-time greetings, a viewer queue, role groups, and watch time. Pick a section from the chips on the left; the line of waiting viewers stays on the right."
    loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.page.a11y"
    loc:Localize.HelpTextKey="panel.usermgmt.page.help">

    <!--
        ══════════════════ THE HOUSE TOOL-PAGE SHELL ══════════════════

        Row 0  ToolPageHeader — the 48 px band: name · master switch · ONE state
               phrase. It replaces THREE rows this page used to stack — the action
               strip, the ToolStatusPill inside it, and the pinned master-state
               banner at the top of the left column — which between them rendered
               the same boolean in three vocabularies (DISABLED / OFF / dormant)
               above a strip of stat tiles reading 0 on a fresh install.
        Row 1  two-column body, no ColumnSpacing: the right column's left border
               IS the divider.

               LEFT  *    every SETTING, behind the section nav —
                           WELCOMING · GREETING · QUEUE · OVERLAY · REPLIES ·
                           GROUPS · WATCH TIME.

                           ★ WATCH TIME is the one section that is NOT this tool's
                           config. Its three sampler settings are AppConfig, written
                           straight through ConfigManager.SaveDeferred, because watch
                           time records with every pre-build tool switched off. It
                           lives on this page because this is where those hours are
                           spent — the group cards turn them into memberships.
               RIGHT 300  NOW WAITING (the live queue). A fixed width, not a
                          proportion: a live list of logins does not get wider
                          because the window did, and the settings column is the
                          one that has fields to fit.

        ★ THE PILL IS RE-SCOPED, NOT DELETED. ToolStatusPill, the service-side
        UserManagementService.PillState machine and PreBuildStatusPillTests all
        stay exactly as they were — they carry the honesty audit where partial
        states were refused a green light. This page now renders that same
        predicate's result in the header band instead of in a pill; see
        UserManagementView.UpdateHeaderState, which reads StatusPillText and
        StatusPulsing and invents no state of its own.

        WHY THE QUEUE IS THE LIVE COLUMN. It is the only surface here that a
        chat command or a script's Queue.Push can change while the panel is open:
        it is rebuilt from the service on every RuntimeChanged. Groups deliberately
        stay in the detail column — promoting them would cost the only column that
        can honestly be called live.

        WHY A SELECTOR AND NOT A PIVOT. Pivot is banned in this codebase (it
        realizes lazily, which is the crash class this project has already paid
        for). ToolSectionSelector owns no content: this page owns each section
        body and its Visibility, and every body stays in the visual tree, so a
        focused TextBox commits its LostFocus edit even when the section changes.

        THE FIVE SECTION GATES STAY WITH THEIR SECTIONS. Only the master moved to
        the header band. Welcoming, general-welcome, greeting, queue and overlay
        each keep their own switch inside the card it governs — and the three that
        used to sit beside a section eyebrow now sit alone on that eyebrow's rule,
        because the nav above already names the section.

        NO IsEnabled GATE ANYWHERE ON THIS PAGE, and that is deliberate. Nothing
        on the old page was gated on the master switch, and greying the body now
        would stop a streamer configuring the tool before switching it on — a
        behaviour regression dressed up as a layout change. The header's state
        phrase says what "off" means instead. (Corollary: none of the
        IsEnabled-on-a-Panel markup-compiler traps can bite here, because this
        page binds IsEnabled nowhere.)

        NO STAT STRIP, NO ACTIVITY FEED. Both were watch surfaces on a config
        page: four tiles reading 0 0 0 0 on a fresh install, and two feeds
        answering "what happened 40 seconds ago" to someone who came here to
        change a threshold. The one count worth a glance — how many are waiting —
        is in the live column's own header, where the list it counts is.

        NO ENTRANCE ANIMATION. the Pre-Builds rail already runs FadeSlideIn on every tool
        activation; the page-side entrance this file used to run was the second of
        two.

        ★ LOCALIZATION. Every x:Name'd TextBlock below is re-pointed at a
        lang-bundle key in UserManagementView.ApplyLocalizedText, and the XAML
        literal is that key's English fallback. Renaming or dropping one silently
        reverts a German / French / Spanish user to English on that line — and
        dropping the ELEMENT without dropping its assignment line is a CS0103,
        so the two always move together.

        ★ Nine names left this pass and their assignment lines left with them:
        the six section eyebrows that repeated their own nav label
        (GreetingSectionEyebrow, QueueSectionEyebrow, QueueOverlayEyebrow,
        QueueRepliesEyebrow, GroupsSectionEyebrow, WatchTimeSectionEyebrow — a
        seventh, WELCOMING, was a literal with no name), PageScopeHint with the
        banner, and QueueEmptyTitle with the queue's two-line empty state.
        NOT ONE LANG KEY WAS REMOVED: six of the seven eyebrow keys are the very
        keys the nav labels itself with in ApplyLocalizedText, so they are still
        read on every page open.

        Text inside a DataTemplate cannot be reached that way — a templated card
        has no page namescope — so the group cards' and watch-time rows' own
        strings go through Localizer in their ROW VMs instead (GroupRowVm,
        PlatformGroupRowVm, WatchTimeRowVm). Same bundle, different hook.
    -->

    <UserControl.Resources>
        <ResourceDictionary>
            <ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>
                <!-- KEPT, checked type by type: after the conversions below this
                     page still declares TextBox everywhere (queue name, verbs,
                     numerics, the eleven reply templates, welcome and group
                     bodies). It declares no ComboBox, no ToggleSwitch, no CheckBox
                     and no Pivot; the twelve checkboxes in the two role gates
                     belong to RoleCheckRow, which merges this dictionary itself. -->
                <ResourceDictionary Source="ms-appx:///Panels/Common/ToolControlStyles.xaml" />
                <!-- Keyed-only shell styles. Never merged into App.xaml. -->
                <ResourceDictionary Source="ms-appx:///Panels/Common/ToolShellStyles.xaml" />
            </ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>

            <!-- Flush card: Padding 0 so a CoalRaised header band can run edge to
                 edge. Used by the welcome and group cards, which both open with one. -->
            <Style x:Key="UmCardFlush" TargetType="Border">
                <Setter Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource CoalShellBrush}" />
                <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource CoalCardBrush}" />
                <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1" />
                <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{StaticResource Radius1Corner}" />
                <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
                <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,0,12" />
            </Style>

            <!-- In-card group separator. -->
            <Style x:Key="UmHairline" TargetType="Border">
                <Setter Property="Height" Value="1" />
                <Setter Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource CoalRaisedBrush}" />
            </Style>

            <!-- Borderless host for a converted CheckBox / ToggleSwitch. The Button
                 owns the Click, the accessible name and the tooltip; the TogglePill
                 inside it is display-only. -->
            <Style x:Key="UmPillHost" TargetType="Button">
                <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0,4,10,4" />
                <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
                <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
                <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{StaticResource Radius1Corner}" />
                <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center" />
            </Style>

            <!-- ════════ One waiting viewer, in the 300 px live column ════════
                 Read-only by design — the line lives in the databank, not in the
                 config blob, so there is nothing here to edit and the row is
                 rebuilt wholesale whenever the queue changes. Its one action is
                 removal, and that goes through the SERVICE so it writes the same
                 store, raises the same Queue.OnChanged and refreshes the same
                 overlay as the chat verb.
                 ItemsControl → ItemsRepeater host: safe, because no code-behind
                 walks the visual tree for queue rows. -->
            <DataTemplate x:Key="QueueRowTemplate" x:DataType="local:QueueRowVm">
                <Grid Padding="14,7"
                      ColumnSpacing="8"
                      BorderBrush="{StaticResource CoalRaisedBrush}"
                      BorderThickness="0,0,0,1">
                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="0"
                               Text="{x:Bind PositionText}"
                               FontFamily="{StaticResource MonoFont}"
                               FontSize="13"
                               MinWidth="26"
                               TextAlignment="Right"
                               Foreground="{StaticResource EmberPrimaryBrush}"
                               VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                    <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Spacing="1" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Display}"
                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoBodyTextStyle}"
                                   TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                        <!-- Secondary login line only when it differs from the
                             display name — the difference is exactly what a
                             moderator needs when the two disagree. -->
                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind LoginHint}"
                                   Visibility="{x:Bind LoginHintVisibility}"
                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}" />
                    </StackPanel>
                    <!-- Priority badge only when the entry actually carries weight. -->
                    <Border Grid.Column="2"
                            Visibility="{x:Bind PriorityVisibility}"
                            Background="{StaticResource CoalRaisedBrush}"
                            CornerRadius="{StaticResource Radius1Corner}"
                            Padding="6,2" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind PriorityText}"
                                   FontFamily="{StaticResource MonoFont}" FontSize="10"
                                   Foreground="{StaticResource CoalSecondaryTextBrush}" />
                    </Border>
                    <Button Grid.Column="3"
                            Style="{StaticResource ToolDangerButtonStyle}"
                            MinWidth="40" Padding="0"
                            Click="OnRemoveQueueRowClick"
                            AutomationProperties.Name="Remove this viewer from the queue"
                            loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.row.remove.a11y">
                        <FontIcon FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets" Glyph="&#xE711;" FontSize="11"
                                  Foreground="{StaticResource ErrBrush}" />
                    </Button>
                </Grid>
            </DataTemplate>

            <!-- ════════ One personalized welcome ════════
                 Raised header band, always-open settings body. ItemsControl →
                 ItemsRepeater host: safe, no visual-tree walk on this list. -->
            <DataTemplate x:Key="WelcomeRowTemplate" x:DataType="local:WelcomeRowVm">
                <Border Style="{StaticResource UmCardFlush}">
                    <StackPanel>

                        <!-- Header band: icon + username eyebrow + enable pill + delete.
                             CornerRadius 1,1,0,0 = card's Radius1 (2) minus the 1px border,
                             so the raised band doesn't poke past the rounded top corners. -->
                        <Border Background="{StaticResource CoalRaisedBrush}"
                                BorderBrush="{StaticResource CoalDividerSubtleBrush}"
                                BorderThickness="0,0,0,1"
                                CornerRadius="1,1,0,0"
                                Padding="14,8">
                            <Grid ColumnSpacing="10">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <FontIcon Grid.Column="0" FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets" Glyph="&#xE77B;"
                                          FontSize="12"
                                          Foreground="{StaticResource EmberPrimaryBrush}"
                                          VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                <TextBlock Grid.Column="1"
                                           Text="{x:Bind TitleEyebrow, Mode=OneWay}"
                                           Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}"
                                           TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"
                                           VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                <Button Grid.Column="2"
                                        Style="{StaticResource UmPillHost}"
                                        Click="OnToggleWelcomeEnabledClick"
                                        AutomationProperties.Name="Personalized welcome enabled"
                                        loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.welcome.row.enabled.a11y">
                                    <cmn:TogglePill IsOn="{x:Bind Enabled, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                    Label="{x:Bind EnabledLabel, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                </Button>
                                <Button Grid.Column="3"
                                        Style="{StaticResource ToolDangerButtonStyle}"
                                        Click="OnDeleteWelcomeClick"
                                        AutomationProperties.Name="Delete personalized welcome"
                                        loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.welcome.row.delete.a11y">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                        <FontIcon FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets" Glyph="&#xE74D;" FontSize="11"
                                                  Foreground="{StaticResource ErrBrush}" />
                                        <TextBlock Text="DELETE" Style="{StaticResource ToolStripLabelTextStyle}"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.welcome.row.delete.label" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Button>
                            </Grid>
                        </Border>

                        <!-- Settings body -->
                        <StackPanel Margin="14,12,14,14" Spacing="10">

                            <Grid ColumnSpacing="10">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="80" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="Username"
                                           Style="{StaticResource ToolSettingsLabelTextStyle}"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.welcome.row.username.label" />
                                <TextBox Grid.Column="1"
                                         Text="{x:Bind Username, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                         PlaceholderText="viewer login"
                                         HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                         Width="240"
                                         AutomationProperties.Name="Welcome username"
                                         loc:Localize.PlaceholderKey="panel.usermgmt.welcome.row.username.placeholder"
                                         loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.welcome.row.username.a11y" />
                            </Grid>

                            <StackPanel Spacing="3">
                                <TextBlock Text="Message" Style="{StaticResource ToolSettingsLabelTextStyle}"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.welcome.row.message.label" />
                                <TextBox Text="{x:Bind Message, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                         PlaceholderText="Look who's here — welcome back, {user}!"
                                         AcceptsReturn="True"
                                         TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                         MinHeight="60"
                                         HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                                         AutomationProperties.Name="Personalized welcome message"
                                         loc:Localize.PlaceholderKey="panel.usermgmt.welcome.row.message.placeholder"
                                         loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.welcome.row.message.a11y" />
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                           Text="Tokens:  {user} = display name  ·  {platform} = twitch / youtube / kick"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.greeting.tokens_hint" />
                            </StackPanel>

                            <!-- CheckBox → TogglePill. The VM keeps its bool? property for
                                 the snapshot path and exposes a plain bool for the pill. -->
                            <Grid ColumnSpacing="10">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="Auto-shoutout on arrival (Twitch only)"
                                           Style="{StaticResource ToolSettingsLabelTextStyle}"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.welcome.row.shoutout.label" />
                                <Button Grid.Column="1"
                                        Style="{StaticResource UmPillHost}"
                                        Click="OnToggleWelcomeShoutoutClick"
                                        AutomationProperties.Name="Auto-shoutout on arrival"
                                        loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.welcome.row.shoutout.a11y">
                                    <cmn:TogglePill IsOn="{x:Bind AutoShoutoutOn, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                    Label="{x:Bind AutoShoutoutLabel, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                </Button>
                            </Grid>

                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>
            </DataTemplate>

            <!-- ════════ One PLATFORM-OWNED group ════════
                 Moderator / VIP / Subscriber. Read-only by construction: no member
                 editor, no delete, no enable — there is nothing here Phoenix decides.
                 The card is deliberately still SHOWN rather than removed, because a
                 streamer who used to keep names in those boxes has to be able to find
                 out where they went; see PlatformGroupRowVm's doc.

                 Flat card, not a collapsible one: there is no body to reveal, and a
                 chevron that opens onto nothing is worse than no chevron. It is also
                 why this list can be an ItemsRepeater while the two below cannot —
                 nothing walks the visual tree for these rows. -->
            <DataTemplate x:Key="PlatformGroupTemplate" x:DataType="local:PlatformGroupRowVm">
                <Border Style="{StaticResource UmCardFlush}">
                    <Grid ColumnSpacing="10" Padding="12,10">
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <!-- Contact-info glyph rather than the group glyph the editable
                             cards use: at a glance, a different KIND of card. -->
                        <FontIcon Grid.Column="0" FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets" Glyph="&#xE77B;" FontSize="12"
                                  Foreground="{StaticResource CoalSecondaryTextBrush}"
                                  VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,2,0,0" />
                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Spacing="2">
                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind NameEyebrow}"
                                       Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}" />
                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind MembershipText}"
                                       Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                       TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                        </StackPanel>
                        <!-- Sits exactly where the editable cards put their member
                             count, so the two kinds of card read apart at a glance. -->
                        <Border Grid.Column="2"
                                Background="{StaticResource CoalRaisedBrush}"
                                CornerRadius="{StaticResource Radius1Corner}"
                                Padding="6,2" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind SourceBadge}"
                                       Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}" />
                        </Border>
                    </Grid>
                </Border>
            </DataTemplate>

            <!-- ════════ The REGULAR group ════════
                 Hand-rolled collapsible card (Expander removed after the hard crash
                 at first Minigames realization). No delete, no enable — membership
                 IS the switch. The only standard group left with a membership Phoenix
                 owns, and the only one that can also be EARNED (the watch-hour rule
                 in the body).
                 ⚠ This list and the custom-group list below stay on ItemsControl.
                 Both host the GroupCard / GroupBody visual-tree walk in
                 UserManagementView.OnToggleGroupClick, and both templates
                 deliberately share the same x:Names, so they must never be
                 consolidated into one repeater with a template selector. -->
            <DataTemplate x:Key="RegularGroupTemplate" x:DataType="local:GroupRowVm">
                <Border x:Name="GroupCard" Style="{StaticResource UmCardFlush}">
                    <StackPanel>
                        <Border Background="{StaticResource CoalRaisedBrush}"
                                BorderBrush="{StaticResource CoalDividerSubtleBrush}"
                                BorderThickness="0,0,0,1"
                                CornerRadius="1,1,0,0"
                                Padding="12,6">
                            <Button Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0"
                                    HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" HorizontalContentAlignment="Stretch"
                                    Padding="0,4"
                                    Click="OnToggleGroupClick"
                                    ToolTipService.ToolTip="Collapse / expand"
                                    loc:Localize.TooltipKey="panel.usermgmt.groups.card.toggle.tip"
                                    AutomationProperties.Name="{x:Bind NameEyebrow, Mode=OneWay}">
                                <Grid ColumnSpacing="8">
                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <FontIcon Grid.Column="0" FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets" Glyph="&#xE716;" FontSize="12"
                                              Foreground="{StaticResource EmberPrimaryBrush}" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{x:Bind NameEyebrow, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{x:Bind MemberCountText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                    <FontIcon Grid.Column="3" FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets"
                                              Glyph="{x:Bind ChevronGlyph, Mode=OneWay}" FontSize="10"
                                              Foreground="{StaticResource CoalSecondaryTextBrush}" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                </Grid>
                            </Button>
                        </Border>
                        <StackPanel x:Name="GroupBody"
                                    Visibility="{x:Bind BodyVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                    Margin="14,10,14,14" Spacing="6">
                            <StackPanel Spacing="3">
                                <TextBlock Text="MEMBERS — ONE USERNAME PER LINE" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.groups.members.label" />
                                <TextBox Text="{x:Bind MembersText, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                         AcceptsReturn="True"
                                         TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                         MinHeight="96"
                                         FontFamily="{StaticResource MonoFont}" FontSize="11"
                                         HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                                         AutomationProperties.Name="Group members"
                                         loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.groups.members.a11y" />
                            </StackPanel>
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource UmHairline}" Margin="0,4" />
                            <!-- THE WATCH-HOUR RULE. A second, independent way into the
                                 group, and the state line under the box is where its two
                                 surprising properties are stated: it is evaluated live on
                                 every check, and it never writes a name into the list
                                 above — which is what makes raising the threshold take the
                                 grant back instead of stranding promoted members.
                                 LostFocus like every other clamping numeric on this page:
                                 a parse that fights the streamer mid-keystroke eats the
                                 first digit of a two-digit number. -->
                            <StackPanel Spacing="3">
                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind WatchHoursLabel}" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}" />
                                <TextBox Text="{x:Bind WatchHoursText, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus}"
                                         HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                         Width="120"
                                         AutomationProperties.Name="Auto-join after hours watched"
                                         loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.groups.watch_hours.a11y" />
                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind WatchHoursStateText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                           Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                           TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>
            </DataTemplate>

            <!-- ════════ One CUSTOM group ════════
                 Same collapsible card, plus an editable name in the body and a
                 delete button in the header band (a plain SIBLING of the expand
                 button, never nested inside it). -->
            <DataTemplate x:Key="CustomGroupTemplate" x:DataType="local:GroupRowVm">
                <Border x:Name="GroupCard" Style="{StaticResource UmCardFlush}">
                    <StackPanel>
                        <Border Background="{StaticResource CoalRaisedBrush}"
                                BorderBrush="{StaticResource CoalDividerSubtleBrush}"
                                BorderThickness="0,0,0,1"
                                CornerRadius="1,1,0,0"
                                Padding="12,6">
                            <Grid ColumnSpacing="10">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <Button Grid.Column="0"
                                        Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0"
                                        HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" HorizontalContentAlignment="Stretch"
                                        Padding="0,4"
                                        Click="OnToggleGroupClick"
                                        ToolTipService.ToolTip="Collapse / expand"
                                        loc:Localize.TooltipKey="panel.usermgmt.groups.custom.toggle.tip"
                                        AutomationProperties.Name="{x:Bind NameEyebrow, Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <Grid ColumnSpacing="8">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <FontIcon Grid.Column="0" FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets" Glyph="&#xE716;" FontSize="12"
                                                  Foreground="{StaticResource EmberPrimaryBrush}" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{x:Bind NameEyebrow, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}"
                                                   TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{x:Bind MemberCountText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                        <FontIcon Grid.Column="3" FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets"
                                                  Glyph="{x:Bind ChevronGlyph, Mode=OneWay}" FontSize="10"
                                                  Foreground="{StaticResource CoalSecondaryTextBrush}" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                    </Grid>
                                </Button>
                                <Button Grid.Column="1"
                                        Style="{StaticResource ToolDangerButtonStyle}"
                                        Click="OnDeleteGroupClick"
                                        AutomationProperties.Name="Delete custom group"
                                        loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.groups.custom.delete.a11y">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                        <FontIcon FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets" Glyph="&#xE74D;" FontSize="11"
                                                  Foreground="{StaticResource ErrBrush}" />
                                        <TextBlock Text="DELETE" Style="{StaticResource ToolStripLabelTextStyle}"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.groups.custom.delete.label" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Button>
                            </Grid>
                        </Border>
                        <StackPanel x:Name="GroupBody"
                                    Visibility="{x:Bind BodyVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                    Margin="14,10,14,14" Spacing="6">
                            <StackPanel Spacing="3">
                                <TextBlock Text="GROUP NAME" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.groups.custom.name.label" />
                                <TextBox Text="{x:Bind Name, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                         PlaceholderText="e.g. Night Crew"
                                         HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                         Width="240"
                                         AutomationProperties.Name="Custom group name"
                                         loc:Localize.PlaceholderKey="panel.usermgmt.groups.custom.name.placeholder"
                                         loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.groups.custom.name.a11y" />
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                           Text="Becomes the {group.&lt;name&gt;} key and the node output."
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.groups.custom.name.hint" />
                            </StackPanel>
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource UmHairline}" Margin="0,4" />
                            <StackPanel Spacing="3">
                                <TextBlock Text="MEMBERS — ONE USERNAME PER LINE" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.groups.custom.members.label" />
                                <TextBox Text="{x:Bind MembersText, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                         AcceptsReturn="True"
                                         TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                         MinHeight="96"
                                         FontFamily="{StaticResource MonoFont}" FontSize="11"
                                         HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                                         AutomationProperties.Name="Group members"
                                         loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.groups.custom.members.a11y" />
                            </StackPanel>
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource UmHairline}" Margin="0,4" />
                            <!-- Same watch-hour rule the Regular card carries, bound to
                                 this group's own UserGroup.AutoWatchHours. -->
                            <StackPanel Spacing="3">
                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind WatchHoursLabel}" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}" />
                                <TextBox Text="{x:Bind WatchHoursText, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus}"
                                         HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                         Width="120"
                                         AutomationProperties.Name="Auto-join after hours watched"
                                         loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.groups.custom.watch_hours.a11y" />
                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind WatchHoursStateText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                           Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                           TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>
            </DataTemplate>

            <!-- ════════ One TOP WATCHER ════════
                 Read-only: the leaderboard is a view of the same rows the browser
                 below it edits, so putting an editor on both would be two places to
                 change one number. Rank is the row's position, which an ItemsRepeater
                 does not hand the template — so it is deliberately absent rather than
                 faked; the list is sorted, and the order IS the rank. -->
            <DataTemplate x:Key="TopWatcherRowTemplate" x:DataType="local:WatchTimeRowVm">
                <Grid Tag="{x:Bind}"
                      Padding="0,5"
                      ColumnSpacing="12"
                      BorderBrush="{StaticResource CoalDividerBrush}"
                      BorderThickness="0,0,0,1">
                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                    <!-- Display and its hint are OneWay, not the x:Bind default: a
                         row can outlive the moment its viewer's real name is learned
                         (see WatchTimeRowVm.UpdateDisplay). -->
                    <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Spacing="1">
                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Display, Mode=OneWay}"
                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoBodyTextStyle}"
                                   TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind LoginHint}"
                                   Visibility="{x:Bind LoginHintVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}" />
                    </StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1"
                               Text="{x:Bind WatchedText, Mode=OneWay}"
                               FontFamily="{StaticResource MonoFont}" FontSize="12"
                               Foreground="{StaticResource EmberPrimaryBrush}"
                               VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                </Grid>
            </DataTemplate>

            <!-- ════════ One BROWSED viewer, with the manual correction ════════
                 Two number boxes and two buttons. The boxes are bound TwoWay to the
                 ROW's edit fields, never to its stored minutes: a background sample
                 may credit this viewer while the streamer is typing, and the two must
                 not fight. APPLY is what moves the stored value.
                 ★ The row VM instance is stable for the panel's life (see
                 WatchTimeRowVm) precisely so a refresh cannot swallow a half-typed
                 correction. -->
            <DataTemplate x:Key="WatchTimeRowTemplate" x:DataType="local:WatchTimeRowVm">
                <Grid Tag="{x:Bind}"
                      Padding="0,6"
                      ColumnSpacing="8"
                      BorderBrush="{StaticResource CoalDividerBrush}"
                      BorderThickness="0,0,0,1">
                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                    <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Spacing="1" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Display, Mode=OneWay}"
                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoBodyTextStyle}"
                                   TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind LoginHint}"
                                   Visibility="{x:Bind LoginHintVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}" />
                    </StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1"
                               Text="{x:Bind WatchedText, Mode=OneWay}"
                               FontFamily="{StaticResource MonoFont}" FontSize="11"
                               MinWidth="70"
                               TextAlignment="Right"
                               Foreground="{StaticResource CoalSecondaryTextBrush}"
                               VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                    <TextBox Grid.Column="2"
                             Text="{x:Bind HoursEdit, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus}"
                             Width="56"
                             VerticalAlignment="Center"
                             PlaceholderText="h"
                             AutomationProperties.Name="Watch time hours"
                             loc:Localize.PlaceholderKey="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.row.hours.placeholder"
                             loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.row.hours.a11y" />
                    <TextBox Grid.Column="3"
                             Text="{x:Bind MinutesEdit, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus}"
                             Width="56"
                             VerticalAlignment="Center"
                             PlaceholderText="m"
                             AutomationProperties.Name="Watch time minutes"
                             loc:Localize.PlaceholderKey="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.row.minutes.placeholder"
                             loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.row.minutes.a11y" />
                    <Button Grid.Column="4"
                            Style="{StaticResource ToolSecondaryButtonStyle}"
                            VerticalAlignment="Center"
                            Click="OnApplyWatchTimeClick"
                            AutomationProperties.Name="Apply this watch time"
                            loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.row.apply.a11y">
                        <TextBlock Text="SET" Style="{StaticResource ToolStripLabelTextStyle}"
                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.row.apply.label" />
                    </Button>
                    <Button Grid.Column="5"
                            Style="{StaticResource ToolDangerButtonStyle}"
                            MinWidth="40" Padding="0"
                            VerticalAlignment="Center"
                            Click="OnResetWatchTimeClick"
                            AutomationProperties.Name="Reset this viewer's watch time to zero"
                            loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.row.reset.a11y">
                        <!-- The page's destructive glyph, same as RESET MEMORY and
                             CLEAR: this zeroes a total that can only be re-earned in
                             real time, so it must not read as a refresh. -->
                        <FontIcon FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets" Glyph="&#xE74D;" FontSize="11"
                                  Foreground="{StaticResource ErrBrush}" />
                    </Button>
                </Grid>
            </DataTemplate>
        </ResourceDictionary>
    </UserControl.Resources>

    <Grid Background="{StaticResource CoalSurfaceBrush}">
        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
            <RowDefinition Height="*" />
        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

        <!-- ══════════════════ ROW 0 — HEADER BAND ══════════════════
             Title, master switch, one state phrase. Everything is set from
             code-behind (ApplyLocalizedText + UpdateHeaderState) because the
             control takes plain properties, not DependencyProperties.

             NO PRIMARY CTA HERE, deliberately. The band allows exactly one, and
             this page already has two section-scoped brass CTAs that must stay
             where the lists they add to are (ADD in WELCOMING, ADD GROUP in
             GROUPS) — hoisting either would put two brass CTAs on one visible
             surface and move an add-verb away from its list.

             The master still writes through ViewModel.MasterEnabled, which uses
             SaveNow (no 400 ms debounce) exactly as before, and the five SECTION
             gates did not move. -->
        <cmn:ToolPageHeader Grid.Row="0" x:Name="PageHeader" />

        <!-- ══════════════════ ROW 1 — TWO-COLUMN BODY ══════════════════ -->
        <Grid Grid.Row="1">
            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                <ColumnDefinition Width="300" />
            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

            <!-- ───────────── LEFT * : the settings ───────────── -->
            <Grid Grid.Column="0">
                <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                    <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />   <!-- section nav    -->
                    <RowDefinition Height="*" />      <!-- section bodies -->
                </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                <!-- The section nav. Labels are assigned from code-behind at
                     Loaded so six of the seven can reuse the lang keys the page
                     already ships; see ApplyLocalizedText.
                     ★ Padding is HORIZONTAL ONLY: the nav is a 40 px control whose
                     selected item is carried by a 2 px bottom edge, and that edge
                     has to land on this border's own hairline. Vertical padding
                     would float it in the middle of the row. -->
                <Border Grid.Row="0"
                        Background="{StaticResource CoalSurfaceBrush}"
                        BorderBrush="{StaticResource CoalDividerBrush}"
                        BorderThickness="0,0,0,1"
                        Padding="14,0">
                    <cmn:ToolSectionSelector x:Name="SectionSelector"
                                             SelectedIndex="{x:Bind ViewModel.SelectedSection, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                             AutomationProperties.Name="Section"
                                             loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.nav.a11y" />
                </Border>

                <ScrollViewer Grid.Row="1"
                              x:Name="DetailScroll"
                              VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto"
                              HorizontalScrollMode="Disabled">
                    <StackPanel Spacing="12" Padding="14">

                        <!-- ══════════════ 0 — WELCOMING ══════════════ -->
                        <StackPanel Visibility="{x:Bind ViewModel.WelcomingSectionVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                    Spacing="12">

                            <!-- Section gate on its rule. The eyebrow that used to
                                 open this row said "WELCOMING", which is what the nav
                                 chip directly above it says; the gate is what the row
                                 was actually for. -->
                            <Grid ColumnSpacing="10">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <Border Grid.Column="0" Height="1"
                                        Background="{StaticResource CoalDividerBrush}"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                <Button Grid.Column="1"
                                        Style="{StaticResource UmPillHost}"
                                        Click="OnToggleWelcomingClick"
                                        AutomationProperties.Name="Welcoming enabled"
                                        loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.welcoming.gate.a11y">
                                    <cmn:TogglePill IsOn="{x:Bind ViewModel.WelcomingEnabled, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                    Label="{x:Bind ViewModel.WelcomingEnabledLabel, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                </Button>
                            </Grid>

                            <!-- General welcome card -->
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource ToolSectionCardStyle}">
                                <StackPanel Spacing="10">
                                    <Grid ColumnSpacing="12">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Spacing="2" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                            <TextBlock Text="GENERAL WELCOME" Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.welcoming.general.eyebrow" />
                                            <!-- Precedence, stated because the card cannot show it:
                                                 OnChatMessageAsync picks personalized row → once-ever
                                                 greeting → this line, and stops at the first hit. -->
                                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                                       Text="Sent on a first message each stream to anyone with no personalized row · a brand-new chatter gets the first-time greeting instead"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.welcoming.general.hint" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <Button Grid.Column="1"
                                                Style="{StaticResource UmPillHost}"
                                                Click="OnToggleGeneralWelcomeClick"
                                                AutomationProperties.Name="Greet everyone's first message"
                                                loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.welcoming.general.gate.a11y">
                                            <cmn:TogglePill IsOn="{x:Bind ViewModel.GeneralWelcomeEnabled, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                            Label="{x:Bind ViewModel.GeneralWelcomeEnabledLabel, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                        </Button>
                                    </Grid>
                                    <Border Style="{StaticResource UmHairline}" />
                                    <StackPanel Spacing="3">
                                        <TextBlock Text="Message" Style="{StaticResource ToolSettingsLabelTextStyle}"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.welcoming.general.message.label" />
                                        <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.GeneralWelcomeMessage, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                                 PlaceholderText="Welcome {user}! Enjoy your stay."
                                                 AcceptsReturn="True"
                                                 TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                 MinHeight="60"
                                                 HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                                                 AutomationProperties.Name="General welcome message"
                                                 loc:Localize.PlaceholderKey="panel.usermgmt.welcoming.general.message.placeholder"
                                                 loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.welcoming.general.message.a11y" />
                                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                                   Text="Tokens:  {user} = display name  ·  {platform} = twitch / youtube / kick"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.greeting.tokens_hint" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- Section header: eyebrow + hairline + Add. -->
                            <Grid ColumnSpacing="10">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="PERSONALIZED WELCOMES"
                                           Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}"
                                           VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.welcoming.list.eyebrow" />
                                <Border Grid.Column="1" Height="1"
                                        Background="{StaticResource CoalDividerBrush}"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                <!-- This section's one brass CTA. -->
                                <Button Grid.Column="2"
                                        Style="{StaticResource ToolBrassCtaStyle}"
                                        Click="OnAddWelcomeClick"
                                        AutomationProperties.Name="Add personalized welcome"
                                        loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.welcoming.add.a11y">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                        <FontIcon FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets" Glyph="&#xE710;" FontSize="11"
                                                  Foreground="{StaticResource CoalShellBrush}" />
                                        <TextBlock Text="ADD" Style="{StaticResource ToolBrassCtaLabelTextStyle}"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.welcoming.add.label" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Button>
                            </Grid>

                            <ItemsRepeater ItemsSource="{x:Bind ViewModel.Welcomes, Mode=OneWay}"
                                           cmn:RowDataContext.Supply="True"
                                           ItemTemplate="{StaticResource WelcomeRowTemplate}"
                                           AutomationProperties.Name="Personalized welcomes"
                                           loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.welcoming.list.a11y" />

                            <!-- Empty state (the Add button above stays). -->
                            <StackPanel Visibility="{x:Bind ViewModel.WelcomeEmptyVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                        HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,16,0,8" Spacing="8">
                                <TextBlock Text="No personalized welcomes yet"
                                           FontFamily="{StaticResource DisplayFont}"
                                           FontSize="20"
                                           Foreground="{StaticResource CoalSecondaryTextBrush}"
                                           HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.welcoming.empty.title" />
                                <TextBlock Text="Click “Add” to give a specific viewer their own greeting."
                                           FontFamily="{StaticResource SansFont}"
                                           FontSize="12"
                                           Foreground="{StaticResource CoalSecondaryTextBrush}"
                                           HorizontalAlignment="Center" TextAlignment="Center"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.welcoming.empty.body" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <!-- ══════════════ 1 — FIRST-TIME GREETING ══════════════ -->
                        <StackPanel Visibility="{x:Bind ViewModel.GreetingSectionVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                    Spacing="12">

                            <!-- Gate on its rule; the "GREETING" eyebrow that used to
                                 open it duplicated the nav chip above, key and all. -->
                            <Grid ColumnSpacing="10">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <Border Grid.Column="0" Height="1"
                                        Background="{StaticResource CoalDividerBrush}"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                <Button Grid.Column="1"
                                        Style="{StaticResource UmPillHost}"
                                        Click="OnToggleGreetingClick"
                                        AutomationProperties.Name="First-time greeting enabled"
                                        loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.greeting.gate.a11y">
                                    <cmn:TogglePill IsOn="{x:Bind ViewModel.GreetingEnabled, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                    Label="{x:Bind ViewModel.GreetingEnabledLabel, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                </Button>
                            </Grid>

                            <Border Style="{StaticResource ToolSectionCardStyle}">
                                <StackPanel Spacing="10">
                                    <StackPanel Spacing="2">
                                        <TextBlock x:Name="GreetingCardEyebrow" Text="FIRST-TIME GREETING"
                                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.greeting.card_eyebrow" />
                                        <TextBlock x:Name="GreetingCardHint" Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                                   Text="Chatters seen before the tool was enabled count as new once."
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.greeting.card_hint" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <Border Style="{StaticResource UmHairline}" />
                                    <StackPanel Spacing="3">
                                        <TextBlock x:Name="GreetingMessageLabel" Text="Message"
                                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolSettingsLabelTextStyle}"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.greeting.message_label" />
                                        <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.GreetingMessage, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                                 PlaceholderText="Welcome to the channel, {user}! Great to have you here for the first time."
                                                 AcceptsReturn="True"
                                                 TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                 MinHeight="60"
                                                 HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                                                 AutomationProperties.Name="First-time greeting message"
                                                 loc:Localize.PlaceholderKey="panel.usermgmt.greeting.message.placeholder"
                                                 loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.greeting.message.a11y" />
                                        <TextBlock x:Name="GreetingTokensHint" Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                                   Text="Tokens:  {user} = display name  ·  {platform} = twitch / youtube / kick"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.greeting.tokens_hint" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <Grid ColumnSpacing="12">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                                   VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                   Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.KnownChattersText, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                        <!-- Confirmed destructive op — the ContentDialog is a
                                             sanctioned exception, not a repeatable rejection. -->
                                        <Button Grid.Column="1"
                                                Style="{StaticResource ToolDangerButtonStyle}"
                                                Click="OnResetKnownChattersClick"
                                                AutomationProperties.Name="Reset known chatters"
                                                loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.greeting.reset.a11y">
                                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                                <FontIcon FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets" Glyph="&#xE74D;" FontSize="11"
                                                          Foreground="{StaticResource ErrBrush}" />
                                                <TextBlock x:Name="ResetMemoryButtonText" Text="RESET MEMORY"
                                                           Style="{StaticResource ToolStripLabelTextStyle}"
                                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.greeting.reset_button" />
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Button>
                                    </Grid>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- GONE: the durable FIRST SEEN feed. It was a watch
                                 surface on a config section — a scrolling list of who
                                 first typed and when, above nothing a streamer can act
                                 on here. Its one actionable summary, "N chatters
                                 remembered", is still on the card above, next to the
                                 button that clears exactly that set. The durable
                                 UserMgmtSeenEver store and its service read are
                                 unchanged; only the render surface (and the VM plumbing
                                 that fed it) is gone. -->
                        </StackPanel>

                        <!-- ══════════════ 2 — VIEWER QUEUE ══════════════ -->
                        <StackPanel Visibility="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueSectionVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                    Spacing="12">

                            <!-- Gate on its rule; the "VIEWER QUEUE" eyebrow that used
                                 to open it duplicated the nav chip above, key and all. -->
                            <Grid ColumnSpacing="10">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <Border Grid.Column="0" Height="1"
                                        Background="{StaticResource CoalDividerBrush}"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                <Button Grid.Column="1"
                                        Style="{StaticResource UmPillHost}"
                                        Click="OnToggleQueueClick"
                                        AutomationProperties.Name="Viewer queue enabled"
                                        loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.gate.a11y">
                                    <cmn:TogglePill IsOn="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueEnabled, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                    Label="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueEnabledLabel, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                </Button>
                            </Grid>

                            <!-- Settings card: the queue's name, its four chat verbs, size /
                                 weighting / cooldown, and the two role gates. -->
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource ToolSectionCardStyle}">
                                <StackPanel Spacing="10">
                                    <StackPanel Spacing="2">
                                        <TextBlock x:Name="QueueCardEyebrow" Text="QUEUE SETTINGS"
                                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.card_eyebrow" />
                                        <TextBlock x:Name="QueueCardHint" Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                                   Text="Survives a Hub restart · subs and VIPs can be given a head start"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.card_hint" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <Border Style="{StaticResource UmHairline}" />

                                    <StackPanel Spacing="3">
                                        <TextBlock x:Name="QueueNameLabel" Text="Queue name"
                                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolSettingsLabelTextStyle}"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.name_label" />
                                        <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueName, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                                 PlaceholderText="viewers"
                                                 Width="{StaticResource ToolFieldWidthMd}"
                                                 HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                 AutomationProperties.Name="Queue name"
                                                 loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.name_label" />
                                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                                   Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueNodeHintText, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                    </StackPanel>

                                    <Border Style="{StaticResource UmHairline}" />

                                    <!-- ════ FIELD GEOMETRY, THE ONE RULE THIS CARD NOW KEEPS ════
                                         Every input below is sized by what it HOLDS, from the
                                         ToolFieldWidth tokens — Sm for a chat verb, Xs for an
                                         integer, Md for the name above — and the grids are
                                         LEFT-PACKED (Auto columns, 40 px gap) instead of star.
                                         Star columns stretched a four-character verb and a
                                         two-digit number across ~985 px each, four across, in
                                         two stacked rows; the card read as a spreadsheet and
                                         no two boxes on the page agreed on a width.
                                         ★ The numeric bindings keep UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus.
                                         A clamping parse must not fight the streamer mid-keystroke —
                                         that is what eats the first digit of a two-digit number. -->
                                    <Grid ColumnSpacing="40" RowSpacing="10" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueJoinLabel" Text="JOIN COMMAND" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.join_label" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueJoinCommand, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                                     PlaceholderText="join"
                                                     Width="{StaticResource ToolFieldWidthSm}"
                                                     HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                     AutomationProperties.Name="Queue join command"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.join.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueLeaveLabel" Text="LEAVE COMMAND" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.leave_label" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueLeaveCommand, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                                     PlaceholderText="leave"
                                                     Width="{StaticResource ToolFieldWidthSm}"
                                                     HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                     AutomationProperties.Name="Queue leave command"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.leave.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="0" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueListLabel" Text="LIST COMMAND" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.list_label" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueListCommand, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                                     PlaceholderText="queue"
                                                     Width="{StaticResource ToolFieldWidthSm}"
                                                     HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                     AutomationProperties.Name="Queue list command"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.list.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueuePositionLabel" Text="POSITION COMMAND" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.position_label" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueuePositionCommand, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                                     PlaceholderText="position"
                                                     Width="{StaticResource ToolFieldWidthSm}"
                                                     HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                     AutomationProperties.Name="Queue position command"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.position.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Grid>

                                    <!-- MODERATOR SUB-VERBS. They ride the list command
                                         ("!queue next"), so they are second-word settings
                                         rather than commands of their own — which is exactly
                                         why they were string literals in the parser until this
                                         pass and the only queue words a streamer could neither
                                         see nor change. Blank switches one off: an empty verb
                                         never matches (ChatVerb's empty-never-matches rule),
                                         and the hint line below drops it from the sentence
                                         rather than printing a shape that cannot fire. -->
                                    <StackPanel Spacing="3">
                                        <TextBlock x:Name="QueueModVerbsLabel" Text="Moderator sub-verbs (typed after the list command)"
                                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolSettingsLabelTextStyle}"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.mod_verbs_label" />
                                        <Grid ColumnSpacing="40" RowSpacing="10" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
                                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                                            </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                            <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" Spacing="3">
                                                <TextBlock x:Name="QueueNextSubLabel" Text="CALL NEXT" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.next_sub_label" />
                                                <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueNextSubCommand, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                                         PlaceholderText="next"
                                                         Width="{StaticResource ToolFieldWidthSm}"
                                                         HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                         AutomationProperties.Name="Queue next sub-command"
                                                         loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.next_sub.a11y" />
                                            </StackPanel>
                                            <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" Spacing="3">
                                                <TextBlock x:Name="QueuePickSubLabel" Text="CALL A NAME" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.pick_sub_label" />
                                                <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueuePickSubCommand, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                                         PlaceholderText="pick"
                                                         Width="{StaticResource ToolFieldWidthSm}"
                                                         HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                         AutomationProperties.Name="Queue pick sub-command"
                                                         loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.pick_sub.a11y" />
                                            </StackPanel>
                                            <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="0" Spacing="3">
                                                <TextBlock x:Name="QueueRemoveSubLabel" Text="DROP A NAME" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.remove_sub_label" />
                                                <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueRemoveSubCommand, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                                         PlaceholderText="remove"
                                                         Width="{StaticResource ToolFieldWidthSm}"
                                                         HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                         AutomationProperties.Name="Queue remove sub-command"
                                                         loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.remove_sub.a11y" />
                                            </StackPanel>
                                            <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" Spacing="3">
                                                <TextBlock x:Name="QueueClearSubLabel" Text="EMPTY THE LINE" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.clear_sub_label" />
                                                <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueClearSubCommand, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                                         PlaceholderText="clear"
                                                         Width="{StaticResource ToolFieldWidthSm}"
                                                         HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                         AutomationProperties.Name="Queue clear sub-command"
                                                         loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.clear_sub.a11y" />
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Grid>
                                    </StackPanel>

                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                               Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueModVerbsHintText, Mode=OneWay}" />

                                    <!-- The one collision worth surfacing: !join is also the
                                         Loyalty raffle's default. The built-in chat dispatch
                                         resolves it silently (the raffle answers while one is
                                         live, the queue answers otherwise), which reads as "my
                                         queue randomly stops working" unless the panel says so.
                                         Invisible in a healthy screenshot. -->
                                    <Border Visibility="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueJoinClashVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                            Background="{StaticResource CoalRaisedBrush}"
                                            BorderBrush="{StaticResource WarnBrush}"
                                            BorderThickness="1"
                                            CornerRadius="{StaticResource Radius2Corner}"
                                            Padding="10,8">
                                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                                            <FontIcon FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets" Glyph="&#xE7BA;" FontSize="12"
                                                      Foreground="{StaticResource WarnBrush}" VerticalAlignment="Top" />
                                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                                       Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueJoinClashText, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Border>

                                    <Border Style="{StaticResource UmHairline}" />

                                    <!-- The four numeric boxes are the only bindings on this
                                         page with an explicit UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus:
                                         a clamping parse must not fight the streamer mid-keystroke.
                                         PRESERVED VERBATIM through the re-lay — only the
                                         column count and the widths changed. -->
                                    <Grid ColumnSpacing="40" RowSpacing="10" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueMaxLabel" Text="MAX SIZE (0 = UNLIMITED)" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.max_label" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueMaxSizeText, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus}"
                                                     Width="{StaticResource ToolFieldWidthXs}"
                                                     HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                     AutomationProperties.Name="Queue maximum size"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.max.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueCooldownLabel" Text="COOLDOWN (S)" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.cooldown_label" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueCooldownText, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus}"
                                                     Width="{StaticResource ToolFieldWidthXs}"
                                                     HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                     AutomationProperties.Name="Queue per-user cooldown seconds"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.cooldown.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="0" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueSubPrioLabel" Text="SUB HEAD START" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.sub_priority_label" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueSubPriorityText, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus}"
                                                     Width="{StaticResource ToolFieldWidthXs}"
                                                     HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                     AutomationProperties.Name="Subscriber priority"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.sub_priority.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueVipPrioLabel" Text="VIP HEAD START" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.vip_priority_label" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueVipPriorityText, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus}"
                                                     Width="{StaticResource ToolFieldWidthXs}"
                                                     HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                     AutomationProperties.Name="VIP priority"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.vip_priority.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Grid>
                                    <TextBlock x:Name="QueuePriorityHint" Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                               Text="higher number = further forward · ties keep arrival order · 0 = plain first-come"
                                               loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.priority_hint" />

                                    <Border Style="{StaticResource UmHairline}" />

                                    <!-- ROLE GATES. RoleCheckRow lays out in WrapRowPanel, which
                                         needs a finite-width measure host to fold instead of
                                         clipping: a vertical StackPanel inside a STAR-width card
                                         is that host. Never put one in an Auto column, a
                                         horizontal StackPanel, or a horizontally scrolling host. -->
                                    <StackPanel Spacing="3">
                                        <TextBlock x:Name="QueueJoinRolesLabel" Text="Who may join, leave and check the line"
                                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolSettingsLabelTextStyle}"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.join_roles_label" />
                                        <cmn:RoleCheckRow Roles="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueJoinRoles, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <StackPanel Spacing="3">
                                        <TextBlock x:Name="QueueModRolesLabel" Text="Who may run next / pick / remove / clear"
                                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolSettingsLabelTextStyle}"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.mod_roles_label" />
                                        <cmn:RoleCheckRow Roles="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueModRoles, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <!-- ══════════════ 3 — OVERLAY ══════════════ -->
                        <StackPanel Visibility="{x:Bind ViewModel.OverlaySectionVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                    Spacing="12">
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource ToolSectionCardStyle}">
                                <StackPanel Spacing="10">
                                    <Grid ColumnSpacing="12">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <!-- The "OVERLAY" eyebrow that used to head this card
                                             repeated the nav chip above it (same lang key,
                                             literally). The hint is what the card had to say. -->
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Spacing="2" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueOverlayHint" Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                                       Text="Publishes the line for a List.Live widget · off = the widget goes blank"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.overlay_hint" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <Button Grid.Column="1"
                                                Style="{StaticResource UmPillHost}"
                                                Click="OnToggleQueueOverlayClick"
                                                AutomationProperties.Name="Publish queue to overlay"
                                                loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.overlay.gate.a11y">
                                            <cmn:TogglePill IsOn="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueOverlayEnabled, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                            Label="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueOverlayEnabledLabel, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                        </Button>
                                    </Grid>
                                    <Grid ColumnSpacing="12">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Spacing="3" MinWidth="120">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueOverlaySizeLabel" Text="ROWS SHOWN" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.overlay_size_label" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueOverlaySizeText, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus}"
                                                     AutomationProperties.Name="Overlay rows shown"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.overlay_size.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                                   VerticalAlignment="Bottom"
                                                   Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueOverlayKeyText, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                    </Grid>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <!-- ══════════════ 4 — REPLIES ══════════════ -->
                        <StackPanel Visibility="{x:Bind ViewModel.RepliesSectionVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                    Spacing="12">
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource ToolSectionCardStyle}">
                                <StackPanel Spacing="10">
                                    <!-- The "REPLIES" eyebrow that used to head this card
                                         repeated the nav chip above it, same lang key. The
                                         token line is the only thing the head had to say. -->
                                    <TextBlock x:Name="QueueRepliesTokens" Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                               Text="Tokens:  {user}  ·  {position}  ·  {count}  ·  {list}"
                                               loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.replies_tokens" />
                                    <Border Style="{StaticResource UmHairline}" />
                                    <Grid ColumnSpacing="10" RowSpacing="8">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueMsgJoinedLabel" Text="JOINED" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_joined" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueJoinedMessage, Mode=TwoWay}" AutomationProperties.Name="Queue joined message"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_joined.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueMsgAlreadyLabel" Text="ALREADY IN LINE" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_already" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueAlreadyMessage, Mode=TwoWay}" AutomationProperties.Name="Queue already-joined message"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_already.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>

                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="0" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueMsgFullLabel" Text="QUEUE FULL" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_full" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueFullMessage, Mode=TwoWay}" AutomationProperties.Name="Queue full message"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_full.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueMsgLeftLabel" Text="LEFT" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_left" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueLeftMessage, Mode=TwoWay}" AutomationProperties.Name="Queue left message"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_left.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>

                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="0" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueMsgNotQueuedLabel" Text="NOT IN LINE" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_not_queued" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueNotQueuedMessage, Mode=TwoWay}" AutomationProperties.Name="Queue not-queued message"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_not_queued.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="1" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueMsgPositionLabel" Text="THEIR SPOT" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_position" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueuePositionMessage, Mode=TwoWay}" AutomationProperties.Name="Queue position message"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_position.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>

                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="0" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueMsgListLabel" Text="THE WHOLE LINE" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_list" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueListMessage, Mode=TwoWay}" AutomationProperties.Name="Queue list message"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_list.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="1" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueMsgEmptyLabel" Text="NOBODY WAITING" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_empty" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueEmptyMessage, Mode=TwoWay}" AutomationProperties.Name="Queue empty message"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_empty.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>

                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="0" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueMsgNextLabel" Text="CALLED UP (NEXT / PICK)" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_next" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueNextMessage, Mode=TwoWay}" AutomationProperties.Name="Queue next message"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_next.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="1" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueMsgRemovedLabel" Text="REMOVED BY A MOD" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_removed" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueRemovedMessage, Mode=TwoWay}" AutomationProperties.Name="Queue removed message"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_removed.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>

                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="0" Spacing="3">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueMsgClearedLabel" Text="QUEUE CLEARED" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_cleared" />
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueClearedMessage, Mode=TwoWay}" AutomationProperties.Name="Queue cleared message"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.msg_cleared.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Grid>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <!-- ══════════════ 5 — GROUPS ══════════════ -->
                        <StackPanel Visibility="{x:Bind ViewModel.GroupsSectionVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                    Spacing="12">

                            <!-- The "GROUPS" heading row that used to open this section
                                 said exactly what the nav chip above it says, off the
                                 same lang key, and carried nothing else — so the whole
                                 row went, hairline included. The sentence below is what
                                 this section actually opens with. -->

                            <!-- ★ THE SENTENCE THIS SECTION LIVES OR DIES BY. It used to
                                 say Moderator / VIP / Subscriber "grant that role
                                 suite-wide without the platform rank", which is now
                                 exactly backwards: those three are READ from the platform
                                 and cannot be granted here at all. Every group is still
                                 pickable everywhere a group is picked — what changed is
                                 only who decides who is in one. -->
                            <TextBlock x:Name="GroupsSectionHint" Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                       TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                       Text="Every group below is pickable on any role gate, in {user.is_regular}-style script vars and on User.GetGroups. Moderator / VIP / Subscriber are read from Twitch / YouTube / Kick — Phoenix cannot grant them. Regular and your own groups are yours: a hand-picked list, a watch-hour rule, or both."
                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.groups.section_hint" />

                            <Grid ColumnSpacing="10">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <TextBlock x:Name="GroupsPlatformEyebrow" Grid.Column="0" Text="FROM YOUR PLATFORM"
                                           Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}"
                                           VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.groups.platform_eyebrow" />
                                <Border Grid.Column="1" Height="1"
                                        Background="{StaticResource CoalDividerBrush}"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                            </Grid>

                            <!-- The three platform-owned groups. ItemsRepeater is safe
                                 here (unlike the two lists below): the card is flat, so
                                 nothing walks the visual tree for these rows. -->
                            <ItemsRepeater ItemsSource="{x:Bind ViewModel.PlatformGroups, Mode=OneWay}"
                                           cmn:RowDataContext.Supply="True"
                                           ItemTemplate="{StaticResource PlatformGroupTemplate}"
                                           AutomationProperties.Name="Platform-owned groups"
                                           loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.groups.platform_list.a11y" />

                            <Grid ColumnSpacing="10">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <TextBlock x:Name="GroupsYoursEyebrow" Grid.Column="0" Text="YOUR GROUPS"
                                           Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}"
                                           VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.groups.yours_eyebrow" />
                                <Border Grid.Column="1" Height="1"
                                        Background="{StaticResource CoalDividerBrush}"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                            </Grid>

                            <!-- ⚠ Deliberately still an ItemsControl (see the template
                                 comment): this list hosts the GroupCard / GroupBody
                                 visual-tree walk. One row today — Regular — and a
                                 collection rather than a lone card so it shares that
                                 template with the custom groups. -->
                            <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{x:Bind ViewModel.StandardGroups, Mode=OneWay}"
                                          ItemTemplate="{StaticResource RegularGroupTemplate}" />

                            <Grid ColumnSpacing="10">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="CUSTOM GROUPS"
                                           Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}"
                                           VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.groups.custom_eyebrow" />
                                <Border Grid.Column="1" Height="1"
                                        Background="{StaticResource CoalDividerBrush}"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                <!-- This section's one brass CTA. -->
                                <Button Grid.Column="2"
                                        Style="{StaticResource ToolBrassCtaStyle}"
                                        Click="OnAddGroupClick"
                                        AutomationProperties.Name="Add custom group"
                                        loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.groups.add.a11y">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                        <FontIcon FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets" Glyph="&#xE710;" FontSize="11"
                                                  Foreground="{StaticResource CoalShellBrush}" />
                                        <TextBlock Text="ADD GROUP" Style="{StaticResource ToolBrassCtaLabelTextStyle}"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.groups.add.label" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Button>
                            </Grid>

                            <!-- ⚠ Also still an ItemsControl, and it must never be merged
                                 with the Regular list above: both templates share the
                                 GroupCard / GroupBody names on purpose. -->
                            <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{x:Bind ViewModel.CustomGroups, Mode=OneWay}"
                                          ItemTemplate="{StaticResource CustomGroupTemplate}" />

                            <StackPanel Visibility="{x:Bind ViewModel.CustomGroupsEmptyVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                        HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,16,0,8" Spacing="8">
                                <TextBlock Text="No custom groups yet"
                                           FontFamily="{StaticResource DisplayFont}"
                                           FontSize="20"
                                           Foreground="{StaticResource CoalSecondaryTextBrush}"
                                           HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.groups.empty.title" />
                                <TextBlock Text="Click “Add group” to create your own membership tier."
                                           FontFamily="{StaticResource SansFont}"
                                           FontSize="12"
                                           Foreground="{StaticResource CoalSecondaryTextBrush}"
                                           HorizontalAlignment="Center" TextAlignment="Center"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.groups.empty.body" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <!-- ══════════════ 6 — WATCH TIME ══════════════ -->
                        <!-- ★ THE ONE HUB-WIDE SECTION ON THIS PAGE. The three settings
                             in the first card are AppConfig, not User-Management config:
                             watch time is a passive background data source that records
                             with every pre-build tool switched off, and a Ranks ladder,
                             this page's group rules and any graph's db.top("WatchTime", …)
                             all read the same open table. They are written straight
                             through ConfigManager.SaveDeferred and never touch this VM's
                             debounced tool save — see the WATCH TIME block in
                             UserManagementViewModel.

                             It is surfaced HERE because this is the page where those
                             hours are spent: the group cards two sections up are what
                             turns them into memberships. -->
                        <StackPanel Visibility="{x:Bind ViewModel.WatchTimeSectionVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                    Spacing="12">

                            <!-- The "WATCH TIME" heading row that used to open this
                                 section repeated the nav chip above it, off the same
                                 lang key, and carried nothing else — row and hairline
                                 both gone. RECORDING below is a card head, not a
                                 duplicate, and stays. -->

                            <!-- ── The sampler ── -->
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource ToolSectionCardStyle}">
                                <StackPanel Spacing="10">
                                    <Grid ColumnSpacing="12">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Spacing="2" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="WatchTimeCardEyebrow" Text="RECORDING"
                                                       Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.card_eyebrow" />
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="WatchTimeCardHint" Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                                       TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                       Text="A Hub-wide setting, not this tool's: minutes are recorded with every pre-build tool switched off, into the open “WatchTime” databank table."
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.card_hint" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <Button Grid.Column="1"
                                                Style="{StaticResource UmPillHost}"
                                                Click="OnToggleWatchTrackingClick"
                                                AutomationProperties.Name="Record watch time"
                                                loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.record.a11y">
                                            <cmn:TogglePill IsOn="{x:Bind ViewModel.WatchTimeTrackingEnabled, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                            Label="{x:Bind ViewModel.WatchTimeTrackingLabel, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                        </Button>
                                    </Grid>

                                    <Border Style="{StaticResource UmHairline}" />

                                    <Grid ColumnSpacing="12">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock x:Name="WatchTimeLiveOnlyLabel" Grid.Column="0"
                                                   VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                   Text="Only count while the stream is live"
                                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolSettingsLabelTextStyle}"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.live_only_label" />
                                        <Button Grid.Column="1"
                                                Style="{StaticResource UmPillHost}"
                                                Click="OnToggleWatchLiveOnlyClick"
                                                AutomationProperties.Name="Only count watch time while live"
                                                loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.live_only.a11y">
                                            <cmn:TogglePill IsOn="{x:Bind ViewModel.WatchTimeOnlyWhenLive, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                            Label="{x:Bind ViewModel.WatchTimeOnlyWhenLiveLabel, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                        </Button>
                                    </Grid>

                                    <Grid ColumnSpacing="12">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Spacing="3" MinWidth="120">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="WatchTimePollLabel" Text="SAMPLE EVERY (S)" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.poll_label" />
                                            <!-- Clamped to the same 15-300 band the sampler
                                                 clamps to when it reads the value; a field
                                                 that stored 5 while the loop ran at 15 would
                                                 be the panel lying about the running system. -->
                                            <TextBox Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.PresencePollSecondsText, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus}"
                                                     AutomationProperties.Name="Presence sample interval in seconds"
                                                     loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.poll.a11y" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <TextBlock x:Name="WatchTimePollHint" Grid.Column="1"
                                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                                   VerticalAlignment="Bottom"
                                                   TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                   Text="15-300 · one sample also feeds the viewer list and the Moderator / VIP / Subscriber lookup for viewers who never type"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.poll_hint" />
                                    </Grid>

                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.WatchTimeStateText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               FontFamily="{StaticResource MonoFont}"
                                               FontSize="11"
                                               Foreground="{StaticResource CoalSecondaryTextBrush}"
                                               TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- ── Top watchers ── -->
                            <Grid ColumnSpacing="10">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <TextBlock x:Name="TopWatchersEyebrow" Grid.Column="0" Text="TOP WATCHERS"
                                           Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}"
                                           VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.top_eyebrow" />
                                <Border Grid.Column="1" Height="1"
                                        Background="{StaticResource CoalDividerBrush}"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                            </Grid>

                            <Border Style="{StaticResource ToolSectionCardStyle}">
                                <Grid>
                                    <!-- No ScrollViewer: this list is ten rows and sits in
                                         the page's own detail scroller. A nested scroll
                                         region there is the trapped-wheel bug. -->
                                    <ItemsRepeater ItemsSource="{x:Bind ViewModel.TopWatchers, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                   cmn:RowDataContext.Supply="True"
                                                   ItemTemplate="{StaticResource TopWatcherRowTemplate}"
                                                   AutomationProperties.Name="Top watchers"
                                                   loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.top_list.a11y" />
                                    <TextBlock x:Name="TopWatchersEmptyText"
                                               Visibility="{x:Bind ViewModel.TopWatchersEmptyVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                               Text="Nobody has accrued watch time yet."
                                               loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.top_empty" />
                                </Grid>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- ── The browser ── -->
                            <Grid ColumnSpacing="10">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <TextBlock x:Name="WatchBrowserEyebrow" Grid.Column="0" Text="EVERY VIEWER"
                                           Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}"
                                           VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.browser_eyebrow" />
                                <Border Grid.Column="1" Height="1"
                                        Background="{StaticResource CoalDividerBrush}"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                <!-- TextChanged rather than a TwoWay binding, the
                                     SystemLog / EventLog / Webhook search idiom: TextBox.Text
                                     commits on LostFocus in WinUI, and a search box that only
                                     filters once you click away is a search box nobody trusts.
                                     The VM coalesces the re-projection. -->
                                <TextBox x:Name="WatchSearchBox" Grid.Column="2"
                                         Width="200"
                                         FontFamily="{StaticResource MonoFont}"
                                         FontSize="11"
                                         VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                         PlaceholderText="viewer…"
                                         TextChanged="OnWatchSearchTextChanged"
                                         AutomationProperties.Name="Search tracked viewers"
                                         loc:Localize.PlaceholderKey="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.search_placeholder"
                                         loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.search.a11y" />
                            </Grid>

                            <Border Style="{StaticResource ToolSectionCardStyle}">
                                <StackPanel Spacing="6">
                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.WatchBrowserCountText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                               TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                                    <TextBlock x:Name="WatchBrowserHint" Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                               TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                               Text="Type hours and minutes, then SET to correct a viewer's total. The reset button zeroes it."
                                               loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.browser_hint" />
                                    <ItemsRepeater ItemsSource="{x:Bind ViewModel.Watchers, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                   cmn:RowDataContext.Supply="True"
                                                   ItemTemplate="{StaticResource WatchTimeRowTemplate}"
                                                   AutomationProperties.Name="Tracked viewers"
                                                   loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.watchtime.browser_list.a11y" />
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- The tool's chat verbs, rendered from the same config the
                                 parser reads — including the four moderator sub-verbs,
                                 which have no command of their own to be found under. -->
                            <cmn:ToolCommandList Commands="{x:Bind ViewModel.ChatCommands, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                 AutomationProperties.Name="User Management chat commands"
                                                 loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.commands.a11y" />
                        </StackPanel>

                    </StackPanel>
                </ScrollViewer>
            </Grid>

            <!-- ───────────── RIGHT 300 : the live line ───────────── -->
            <Border Grid.Column="1"
                    Background="{StaticResource CoalSurfaceBrush}"
                    BorderBrush="{StaticResource CoalCardBrush}"
                    BorderThickness="1,0,0,0">
                <Grid>
                    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />   <!-- header            -->
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />   <!-- eyebrow + CLEAR   -->
                        <RowDefinition Height="*" />      <!-- the line          -->
                    </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                    <!-- The one legal PanelHeader in the house shell: the right
                         column's own header. Its RightContent is where the ONE
                         count worth a glance survived the stat strip's removal —
                         waiting viewers, sitting on the list it counts, still read
                         from the SERVICE's cached total (a script's Queue.Push moves
                         it too) rather than from the collection below. -->
                    <cmn:PanelHeader Grid.Row="0" Eyebrow="LIVE" Title="Viewer queue"
                                     EyebrowKey="panel.common.eyebrow.live"
                                     TitleKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.panel_title">
                        <cmn:PanelHeader.RightContent>
                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.StatQueueValue, Mode=OneWay}"
                                       FontFamily="{StaticResource MonoFont}" FontSize="11"
                                       Foreground="{StaticResource CoalSecondaryTextBrush}"
                                       VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                        </cmn:PanelHeader.RightContent>
                    </cmn:PanelHeader>

                    <!-- CLEAR stays adjacent to the line it clears rather than moving
                         to the strip's danger slot: it is the only destructive verb a
                         streamer reaches for WHILE looking at the queue, and its label
                         is one of the page's localized strings. -->
                    <Border Grid.Row="1"
                            Background="{StaticResource CoalRaisedBrush}"
                            BorderBrush="{StaticResource CoalDividerBrush}"
                            BorderThickness="0,0,0,1"
                            Padding="14,6">
                        <Grid ColumnSpacing="10">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <TextBlock x:Name="QueueNowWaitingEyebrow" Grid.Column="0" Text="NOW WAITING"
                                       Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}"
                                       VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.now_waiting" />
                            <Button Grid.Column="2"
                                    Style="{StaticResource ToolDangerButtonStyle}"
                                    Click="OnClearQueueClick"
                                    AutomationProperties.Name="Clear the viewer queue"
                                    loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.clear.a11y">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                    <FontIcon FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets" Glyph="&#xE74D;" FontSize="11"
                                              Foreground="{StaticResource ErrBrush}" />
                                    <TextBlock x:Name="QueueClearButtonText" Text="CLEAR"
                                               Style="{StaticResource ToolStripLabelTextStyle}"
                                               loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.clear_button" />
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Button>
                        </Grid>
                    </Border>

                    <Grid Grid.Row="2">
                        <ScrollViewer Visibility="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueListVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                      VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto"
                                      HorizontalScrollMode="Disabled">
                            <ItemsRepeater ItemsSource="{x:Bind ViewModel.Queue, Mode=OneWay}"
                                           cmn:RowDataContext.Supply="True"
                                           ItemTemplate="{StaticResource QueueRowTemplate}"
                                           AutomationProperties.Name="Viewers waiting, front first"
                                           loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.usermgmt.queue.roster.a11y" />
                        </ScrollViewer>

                        <!-- ONE line, top-aligned, in the column's own hint tier.
                             It used to be a 20 px DisplayFont headline over a second
                             explanatory line, centred in a full-height void — three
                             design decisions all spent on the fact that nothing has
                             happened yet. An absence must not outrank live content. -->
                        <TextBlock x:Name="QueueEmptyBody"
                                   Visibility="{x:Bind ViewModel.QueueEmptyVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                   Text="Viewers appear here as soon as they join from chat."
                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                   VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                   Margin="14,12,14,0"
                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.usermgmt.queue.empty_body" />
                    </Grid>

                    <!-- GONE: the session ACTIVITY ring. It answered "what happened 40
                         seconds ago" on a page whose job is changing a threshold, and
                         it ate the bottom of the only genuinely live column here. The
                         service still records to ToolActivityRing; only this page's
                         render surface (and the VM plumbing that fed it) is gone. -->
                </Grid>
            </Border>
        </Grid>
    </Grid>
</UserControl>
